<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Jackson, Tenn., $15.180 mln.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Jackson, Tenn., $15.180 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equitable Securities Corp said it received the verbal award for the $15.180  million of Jackson, Tenn., electric system revenue refunding and improvement bonds, Series 1997 with a top yield of 5.639 percent in 2018.</p>
